#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to manage costs of running jobs on QPUs when using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan on IBM Quantum Platform."
msgstr "Cara mengurus kos menjalankan kerja pada QPU apabila menggunakan Pelan Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan pada IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage cost on the Pay-As-You-Go Plan"
msgstr "Urus kos pada Pelan Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage cost on the Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#manage-cost-on-the-pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Urus kos pada Pelan Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan {#manage-cost-on-the-pay-as-you-go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide describes how to set a cost limit on your Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance.  You can also manage cost by [minimizing a workload's QPU usage](/guides/minimize-time), and setting a [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) on your workloads.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menerangkan cara menetapkan had kos pada instans Pelan Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan anda. Anda juga boleh mengurus kos dengan [meminimumkan penggunaan QPU beban kerja](/guides/minimize-time), dan menetapkan [masa pelaksanaan maksimum](/guides/max-execution-time) pada beban kerja anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _cost limit_ refers to the total cost of all workloads run with this instance since it was created, and it will always be greater than or equal to the total cost. After the instance reaches the specified number of total seconds, no further workloads can be run and no more cost is incurred.\n"
msgstr "_Had kos_ merujuk kepada jumlah kos semua beban kerja yang dijalankan dengan instans ini sejak ia dicipta, dan ia akan sentiasa lebih besar daripada atau sama dengan jumlah kos. Selepas instans mencapai jumlah saat yang ditentukan, tiada beban kerja lanjut boleh dijalankan dan tiada kos tambahan ditanggung.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      The cost limit is always specified in US dollars (USD), then converted to runtime seconds. However, for monthly billing purposes, you are charged in your local currency, specified on your IBM Cloud&reg; account. Because currency exchange rates can fluctuate, the cost for X runtime seconds might be different when initially calculated in USD than when you’re actually charged in your local currency. As a result, if your local currency is not USD, the total amount charged for the number of seconds specified in this field could vary from the dollar amount you specify.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Had kos sentiasa dinyatakan dalam dolar Amerika Syarikat (USD), kemudian ditukar kepada saat masa jalan. Walau bagaimanapun, untuk tujuan bil bulanan, anda dicaj dalam mata wang tempatan anda, seperti yang dinyatakan pada akaun IBM Cloud&reg; anda. Oleh kerana kadar pertukaran mata wang boleh berfluktuasi, kos untuk X saat masa jalan mungkin berbeza apabila dikira pada mulanya dalam USD berbanding apabila anda sebenarnya dicaj dalam mata wang tempatan anda. Akibatnya, jika mata wang tempatan anda bukan USD, jumlah keseluruhan yang dicaj untuk bilangan saat yang dinyatakan dalam medan ini mungkin berbeza daripada jumlah dolar yang anda nyatakan.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cost-limit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cost-limit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set or change a cost limit {#set-or-change-a-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Tetapkan atau ubah had kos {#set-or-change-a-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to set or change a limit on how much is spent:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat beberapa cara untuk menetapkan atau mengubah had berapa banyak yang dibelanjakan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **IBM Quantum Platform**: Open the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Find the instance you want to limit, click the Actions menu at the end of the row, and then click **Edit details**. Set the total cost limit or the usage limit, then click **Save changes**.\n"
"   <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   You can also set the cost or usage limit when creating a new instance under the Pay-As-You-Go Plan. When you select the Pay-As-You-Go tile, a field appears with the label \"Total cost limit (Optional)\". You can enter a total cost limit in this field.\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"* **IBM Quantum Platform**: Buka halaman [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Cari instans yang ingin anda hadkan, klik menu Tindakan di hujung baris, kemudian klik **Edit butiran**. Tetapkan had jumlah kos atau had penggunaan, kemudian klik **Simpan perubahan**.\n"
"   <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Anda juga boleh menetapkan had kos atau penggunaan semasa mencipta instans baru di bawah Pelan Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan. Apabila anda memilih jubin Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan, medan akan muncul dengan label \"Had jumlah kos (Pilihan)\". Anda boleh memasukkan had jumlah kos dalam medan ini.\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**API**: [Set the instance limit in seconds](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances#tags__instances__operations__replace_instance_data).\n"
msgstr "**API**: [Tetapkan had instans dalam saat](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances#tags__instances__operations__replace_instance_data).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Cloud CLI**: For instructions to use the CLI, refer to [Getting started with the IBM Cloud CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-getting-started).\n"
msgstr "**IBM Cloud CLI**: Untuk arahan menggunakan CLI, rujuk [Bermula dengan IBM Cloud CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-getting-started).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View the cost limit {#view-the-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Lihat had kos {#view-the-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to view the current cost limit:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat beberapa cara untuk melihat had kos semasa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Platform**: The Total cost limit is shown on the Pay-As-You-Go tab of the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) table.\n"
msgstr "**IBM Quantum Platform**: Had jumlah kos ditunjukkan pada tab Bayar Mengikut Penggunaan dalam jadual [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**API**:\n"
msgstr "**API**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   See the [REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"
msgstr "   Lihat [dokumentasi REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a cost limit {#remove-a-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Buang had kos {#remove-a-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can remove the cost limit in several ways:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh membuang had kos dengan beberapa cara:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**IBM Quantum Platform**: Open the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) table. Find the instance you want to update, click the overflow menu at the end of the row, and then click **Edit details**. Delete the total cost limit or the usage, then click **Save changes**.\n"
msgstr "**IBM Quantum Platform**: Buka jadual [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Cari instans yang ingin anda kemas kini, klik menu limpahan di hujung baris, kemudian klik **Edit butiran**. Padam had jumlah kos atau penggunaan, kemudian klik **Simpan perubahan**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**API**: [Set the instance limit to `null`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"
msgstr "**API**: [Tetapkan had instans kepada `null`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Only administrators and owners can edit the instance.  See the [Create access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups) guide for information about assigning access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hanya pentadbir dan pemilik boleh mengedit instans. Lihat panduan [Cipta dasar akses dan kumpulan akses](/guides/access-groups) untuk maklumat tentang menetapkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What happens when the cost limit is reached {#what-happens-when-the-cost-limit-is-reached}"
msgstr "Apa yang berlaku apabila had kos dicapai {#what-happens-when-the-cost-limit-is-reached}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a running job reports usage that causes the instance's cost limit to be exceeded, currently running jobs from that instance are stopped, their statuses are set to `Canceled` with a reason of `Ran too long`, and the account is billed for the usage.\n"
msgstr "Apabila kerja yang sedang berjalan melaporkan penggunaan yang menyebabkan had kos instans dilebihi, kerja yang sedang berjalan dari instans itu dihentikan, status mereka ditetapkan kepada `Canceled` dengan sebab `Ran too long`, dan akaun dikenakan bil untuk penggunaan tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that job runtime is only reported periodically during execution. Therefore, the job might continue to run past the limit, or even to completion, and, as a result, the account can be billed for usage over the specified limit.\n"
msgstr "Ambil perhatian bahawa masa jalan kerja hanya dilaporkan secara berkala semasa pelaksanaan. Oleh itu, kerja mungkin terus berjalan melebihi had, atau bahkan sehingga selesai, dan akibatnya, akaun boleh dikenakan bil untuk penggunaan melebihi had yang ditetapkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "No further jobs submitted by this instance will begin execution until the cost limit is increased.\n"
msgstr "Tiada kerja lanjut yang diserahkan oleh instans ini akan mula pelaksanaan sehingga had kos ditingkatkan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to see what you’re being charged {#how-to-see-what-youre-being-charged}"
msgstr "Cara melihat apa yang dikenakan bayaran {#how-to-see-what-youre-being-charged}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will receive a monthly invoice that provides details about your resource charges. You can check how much has been spent at any time on the [IBM Cloud Billing and usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing) page.\n"
msgstr "Anda akan menerima invois bulanan yang memberikan butiran tentang caj sumber anda. Anda boleh menyemak berapa banyak yang telah dibelanjakan pada bila-bila masa di halaman [Pengebilan dan penggunaan IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page displays usage according to the filters you set. Additionally, you can determine cost per instance or per job at any time from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, as detailed below.\n"
msgstr "Halaman [Analitik](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) memaparkan penggunaan mengikut penapis yang anda tetapkan. Selain itu, anda boleh menentukan kos setiap instans atau setiap kerja pada bila-bila masa daripada halaman [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), seperti yang diperincikan di bawah.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "View instance usage {#view-instance-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat penggunaan instans {#view-instance-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To determine how much has been billed to an instance, from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, click the instance to open its details page. The **Instance usage** field displays the total amount of this instance's QPU usage since it was created.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan berapa banyak yang telah dibil kepada sebuah instans, daripada halaman [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), klik instans untuk membuka halaman butirannya. Medan **Penggunaan instans** memaparkan jumlah keseluruhan penggunaan QPU instans ini sejak ia dicipta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view your billing cycle on the [Billing and usage page](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh melihat kitaran bil anda di [halaman Pengebilan dan penggunaan](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "View workload usage {#view-workload-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat penggunaan beban kerja {#view-workload-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To determine how much has been billed to each workload associated with an instance, from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, click the instance to open its details page. Next, click on the value under **Total workloads (all types)**.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan berapa banyak yang telah dibil kepada setiap beban kerja yang dikaitkan dengan sebuah instans, daripada halaman [Instans](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), klik instans untuk membuka halaman butirannya. Seterusnya, klik pada nilai di bawah **Jumlah beban kerja (semua jenis)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The **Usage** column displays the amount of QPU consumed by the job.\n"
msgstr "Lajur **Penggunaan** memaparkan jumlah QPU yang digunakan oleh kerja itu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up spending notifications {#set-up-spending-notifications}"
msgstr "Sediakan pemberitahuan perbelanjaan {#set-up-spending-notifications}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can set up spending notifications to get notified when your account or a particular service reaches a specific spending threshold that you set. For information, see the [IBM Cloud Account types](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accounts) page. IBM Cloud spending notifications must be used with other methods of cost management for several reasons:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menyediakan pemberitahuan perbelanjaan untuk mendapat pemberitahuan apabila akaun anda atau perkhidmatan tertentu mencapai ambang perbelanjaan tertentu yang anda tetapkan. Untuk maklumat, lihat halaman [Jenis akaun IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accounts). Pemberitahuan perbelanjaan IBM Cloud mesti digunakan bersama kaedah pengurusan kos lain atas beberapa sebab:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The notifications trigger only *after* cost surpasses the specified limit.\n"
msgstr "Pemberitahuan dicetuskan hanya *selepas* kos melebihi had yang ditetapkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cost is submitted to the billing system hourly. Therefore, a long delay might occur between the job submission and the spending notification being sent.\n"
msgstr "Kos diserahkan ke sistem pengebilan setiap jam. Oleh itu, kelewatan yang panjang mungkin berlaku antara penyerahan kerja dan pemberitahuan perbelanjaan yang dihantar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The billing system can take multiple days to get information to the invoicing system, which might cause further delay in notifications. For more information about how the IBM Cloud billing system works, see [Setting spending notifications](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/billing-usage?topic=billing-usage-spending).\n"
msgstr "Sistem pengebilan boleh mengambil masa beberapa hari untuk mendapatkan maklumat ke sistem invois, yang mungkin menyebabkan kelewatan lebih lanjut dalam pemberitahuan. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang cara sistem pengebilan IBM Cloud berfungsi, lihat [Menetapkan pemberitahuan perbelanjaan](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/billing-usage?topic=billing-usage-spending).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [plans](/guides/plans-overview) available to IBM Quantum users.\n"
"- Review suggestions to [minimize job QPU usage](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"- Learn how to set a [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) on jobs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Semak [pelan](/guides/plans-overview) yang tersedia untuk pengguna IBM Quantum.\n"
"- Semak cadangan untuk [meminimumkan penggunaan QPU kerja](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"- Pelajari cara menetapkan [masa pelaksanaan maksimum](/guides/max-execution-time) pada kerja.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
